OL,3,GNEWSA'We offer an alternative approach
OL,4,Ato help hoarders'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is not just the decluttering
OL,7,Fjourney that is important, but
OL,8,Fdecluttering my mind and finding out
OL,9,Fwho I am".
OL,11,FThe words of Pat, 77 who, after decades
OL,12,Fof hoarding, has been getting help from
OL,13,Fa specialist therapeutic project called
OL,14,FRecovering Homes, run by Reaching CIC.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
