OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F358A1790574950
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'We offer an alternative approach
OL,4,Ato help hoarders'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt includes a hoarding clinic and
OL,7,Ffortnightly peer support, along with
OL,8,Fhelp in the home from a
OL,9,Fpsychotherapist, and has directly
OL,10,Fassisted around 150 people in north
OL,11,FStaffordshire with what CEO Georgina
OL,12,FSalt describes as a "hidden" but
OL,13,Fgrowing issue.
OL,15,F"We're really busy, we have multiple
OL,16,Freferrals a week," said Salt, adding
OL,17,Fthat this involves people who only
OL,18,Freach out when they get to crisis
OL,19,Fpoint.
